1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,355
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:08,625 --> 00:00:10,750
Interschool champion, take it easy.

3
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:29,291
Well played.

4
00:00:36,791 --> 00:00:38,333
Your brother plays all right.

5
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:40,291
I happen to beat a champion.

6
00:00:40,375 --> 00:00:41,750
He plays tennis well.

7
00:00:41,833 --> 00:00:43,833
It's too bad he's from a less privileged background.

8
00:00:43,916 --> 00:00:45,166
No wonder he lacks manners.

9
00:00:47,125 --> 00:00:49,041
-What did you say? -Am I wrong?

10
00:00:49,708 --> 00:00:51,041
-Say it again. -Hey.

11
00:00:51,125 --> 00:00:53,333
-Why is your brother so rude? -It's okay.

12
00:00:55,958 --> 00:00:58,958
Someone isn't good at tennis but is great at picking fights.

13
00:00:59,041 --> 00:01:00,833
The Speaker's son.

14
00:01:01,333 --> 00:01:02,250
He started it.

15
00:01:02,833 --> 00:01:03,750
A bit of advice.

16
00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:08,041
Think before you speak.

17
00:01:08,541 --> 00:01:09,666
Don't shame your family.

18
00:01:16,583 --> 00:01:17,958
Won't you offend him?

19
00:01:18,458 --> 00:01:20,708
So what? I've been sick of him for ages.

20
00:01:21,208 --> 00:01:23,166
I'll rise higher than him anyway.

21
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:24,333
What's the fear?

22
00:01:24,416 --> 00:01:25,500
He wasn't wrong.

23
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,125
Others have never seen me as a part of the Hsueh family.

24
00:01:30,333 --> 00:01:31,666
Don't say that.

25
00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:34,708
Dad will know how amazing you are one day.

26
00:01:35,291 --> 00:01:37,250
We'll do big things together as brothers.

27
00:01:39,083 --> 00:01:40,208
Do big things?

28
00:01:41,041 --> 00:01:43,250
You're putting it away? I haven't smoked you.

29
00:01:44,583 --> 00:01:46,666
Oh, so you want to be smoked too?

30
00:02:03,833 --> 00:02:05,666
I have a better idea.

31
00:02:09,375 --> 00:02:11,291
THE FIXERS

32
00:02:28,958 --> 00:02:32,333
BACKSTABBER

33
00:02:32,416 --> 00:02:33,333
HOWIE, MISSED CALL

34
00:02:33,416 --> 00:02:34,625
ONE NEW VOICEMAIL

35
00:02:35,333 --> 00:02:36,791
Dad, hurry back.

36
00:02:37,291 --> 00:02:38,333
There's trouble.

37
00:02:46,833 --> 00:02:47,875
Police station. Hello.

38
00:02:48,375 --> 00:02:49,583
I want to file a report.

39
00:03:07,875 --> 00:03:09,000
My child is innocent.

40
00:03:09,083 --> 00:03:11,583
-He doesn't know anything. -I will leave

41
00:03:13,041 --> 00:03:14,833
when I get the answer I want.

42
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,375
Hey, it's the police.

43
00:03:22,958 --> 00:03:26,000
Is something going on inside? Someone reported a disturbance here.

44
00:03:26,750 --> 00:03:28,291
Speak carefully,

45
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,833
and I'll let your son go.

46
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,875
If anyone is home, please open the door.

47
00:03:35,791 --> 00:03:36,791
Coming!

48
00:03:41,625 --> 00:03:43,916
Neighbors said there was noise coming from here.

49
00:03:44,416 --> 00:03:45,583
Noise?

50
00:03:46,083 --> 00:03:49,125
Maybe I got too loud while hosting live shopping streams.

51
00:03:49,208 --> 00:03:50,666
May I enter and take a look?

52
00:03:51,166 --> 00:03:52,916
Nothing happened, right?

53
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,000
There's no need.

54
00:03:54,083 --> 00:03:55,208
I'll leave you alone.

55
00:03:55,708 --> 00:03:57,458
Tell me when the goods arrive.

56
00:03:57,541 --> 00:03:59,166
Okay.

57
00:04:02,333 --> 00:04:03,916
-Everything's okay? -Yeah.

58
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Mind your volume.

59
00:04:05,083 --> 00:04:06,166
Okay, thank you.

60
00:04:09,875 --> 00:04:10,958
Howie!

61
00:04:11,458 --> 00:04:13,125
Howie! Are you okay?

62
00:04:13,208 --> 00:04:15,916
Howie, you're scaring me! Howie!

63
00:04:16,541 --> 00:04:17,500
Get up!

64
00:04:18,416 --> 00:04:20,750
Answer me! You're scaring me!

65
00:04:20,833 --> 00:04:22,166
Howie!

66
00:04:22,958 --> 00:04:25,125
-Fuck. -Honey, what do we do?

67
00:04:29,291 --> 00:04:30,666
Who exactly were they?

68
00:04:36,541 --> 00:04:38,125
No, I'm telling the police.

69
00:04:38,208 --> 00:04:39,291
You can't.

70
00:04:40,333 --> 00:04:41,875
Why not?

71
00:04:42,958 --> 00:04:45,333
What exactly did you do?

72
00:05:16,625 --> 00:05:20,291
The bribery case against Chao Ming-cheng continues to escalate.

73
00:05:20,375 --> 00:05:23,291
Thackery Huang, chairman of Ching He, was allegedly a middleman.

74
00:05:23,375 --> 00:05:25,291
Further digging by prosecutors revealed

75
00:05:25,375 --> 00:05:28,083
that he might be involved in more than one case.

76
00:05:28,166 --> 00:05:30,416
The latest evidence shows that…

77
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:32,583
I'm giving you a chance to explain.

78
00:05:33,125 --> 00:05:34,625
Who exactly were they?

79
00:05:37,083 --> 00:05:38,708
When our son wakes up,

80
00:05:38,791 --> 00:05:40,000
we will leave here.

81
00:05:41,333 --> 00:05:43,166
What if he doesn't wake up?

82
00:05:44,250 --> 00:05:46,333
What if our son doesn't wake up?

83
00:05:48,708 --> 00:05:50,916
Just how much are you hiding from me?

84
00:05:52,208 --> 00:05:55,250
You're not Mr. Goldie's bodyguard, are you?

85
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:03,833
We are partners.

86
00:06:05,583 --> 00:06:07,291
What kind of partners?

87
00:06:08,916 --> 00:06:10,916
We work for Ching He.

88
00:06:11,625 --> 00:06:13,000
Ching He?

89
00:06:18,041 --> 00:06:18,958
You're here.

90
00:06:19,625 --> 00:06:21,791
It's been a while since we had a drink.

91
00:06:27,083 --> 00:06:29,000
Wait, it's just the two of us today.

92
00:06:30,083 --> 00:06:31,458
We shouldn't have this.

93
00:06:38,833 --> 00:06:42,000
So you have decided to help me get the Primordial Files?

94
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:48,833
As Dad said, I am a Hsueh too. Who would help you if I didn't?

95
00:06:48,916 --> 00:06:50,583
Besides, I joined Ching He

96
00:06:50,666 --> 00:06:53,833
so that I could help the family one day.

97
00:06:54,416 --> 00:06:56,666
I've always known you're the only one I can trust.

98
00:06:57,333 --> 00:07:00,375
If Dad knew about this, he'd be so happy.

99
00:07:02,083 --> 00:07:04,458
What you're doing isn't just for Dad, is it?

100
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:07,083
It's for yourself too, right?

101
00:07:11,458 --> 00:07:14,375
When you first entered politics, I thought Dad forced you.

102
00:07:15,416 --> 00:07:17,333
I didn't expect you to be so ambitious.

103
00:07:22,166 --> 00:07:23,625
Look at this bridge.

104
00:07:24,583 --> 00:07:26,791
It connects two sides of the city.

105
00:07:27,375 --> 00:07:29,416
One side represents power and order.

106
00:07:29,916 --> 00:07:31,958
The other, opportunity and ambition.

107
00:07:32,625 --> 00:07:36,041
Dad believes it's not opposition,

108
00:07:36,625 --> 00:07:38,125
but symbiosis.

109
00:07:38,833 --> 00:07:40,250
But to me,

110
00:07:41,083 --> 00:07:43,833
coexistence is just a form of compromise.

111
00:07:44,541 --> 00:07:48,125
The strong are meant to set the rules for the world.

112
00:07:49,041 --> 00:07:50,250
What I want to do

113
00:07:50,333 --> 00:07:51,875
is to take down the bridge,

114
00:07:51,958 --> 00:07:53,833
so that there is no separation.

115
00:07:53,916 --> 00:07:56,500
Everyone plays by the same rules.

116
00:07:56,583 --> 00:07:58,375
And I get to set them.

117
00:08:00,333 --> 00:08:01,458
I'm just like you.

118
00:08:01,958 --> 00:08:03,625
I don't want to just rely on Dad.

119
00:08:04,125 --> 00:08:06,250
I have my own vision.

120
00:08:08,083 --> 00:08:10,500
If you want me to help you, promise me one thing.

121
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:12,333
Go ahead.

122
00:08:12,416 --> 00:08:14,625
Don't touch Felix Chiang and Mina Shen.

123
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:22,625
Seems like Yeh Yueh Tong hasn't told you everything.

124
00:08:26,250 --> 00:08:28,125
It's okay. I promise you.

125
00:08:39,291 --> 00:08:40,125
Are you okay?

126
00:08:47,750 --> 00:08:49,583
Luckily, my son survived.

127
00:08:50,458 --> 00:08:51,708
But he's still unconscious.

128
00:08:51,791 --> 00:08:55,208
The doctor said the next 48 hours will be critical.

129
00:08:56,875 --> 00:08:58,958
I saw the news. Thackery was arrested.

130
00:09:00,875 --> 00:09:02,125
A new Celestial is coming.

131
00:09:02,208 --> 00:09:05,958
Madam Fan is replacing Thackery as head of Ching He.

132
00:09:07,375 --> 00:09:08,416
What happened?

133
00:09:08,916 --> 00:09:11,250
Madam Fan's father used to lead Ching He.

134
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:15,416
Now she wants to reclaim the position of Fixer Celestial.

135
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:21,250
So is it too late to give this to Thackery?

136
00:09:23,333 --> 00:09:24,458
What is that?

137
00:09:24,541 --> 00:09:26,625
Zoe gave this to me

138
00:09:28,333 --> 00:09:29,333
before she died.

139
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:35,708
Did you read the files?

140
00:09:36,666 --> 00:09:37,791
Not yet.

141
00:09:38,333 --> 00:09:39,916
Zoe wanted me

142
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,333
to hand it over to Thackery.

143
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,333
Give it to me. I'll give it to Thackery.

144
00:09:53,208 --> 00:09:54,666
He was arrested.

145
00:09:55,166 --> 00:09:56,666
How will you give it to him?

146
00:09:57,291 --> 00:09:59,458
I've arranged to visit the detention center.

147
00:10:01,208 --> 00:10:03,708
Zoe said the contents…

148
00:10:05,625 --> 00:10:07,000
are related to your family.

149
00:10:18,041 --> 00:10:19,458
And I've just confirmed

150
00:10:19,541 --> 00:10:22,000
that the Hsueh family was behind Thackery's arrest.

151
00:10:23,125 --> 00:10:27,375
What's on this card might stop Madam Fan from becoming Fixer Celestial.

152
00:10:32,041 --> 00:10:33,250
Trust me.

153
00:10:38,958 --> 00:10:40,625
When Howie wakes up,

154
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:43,458
I will take him and his mother…

155
00:10:47,375 --> 00:10:48,500
away from here.

156
00:10:52,333 --> 00:10:53,458
CHING HE TEMPLE

157
00:11:09,541 --> 00:11:11,708
We were able to get Thackery detained

158
00:11:12,333 --> 00:11:14,083
thanks to you, Sir Hong.

159
00:11:14,958 --> 00:11:18,208
Without you, it wouldn't have gone so smoothly.

160
00:11:18,708 --> 00:11:23,208
It's time for Ching He to move past the old and usher in the new.

161
00:11:23,916 --> 00:11:27,708
You have been through thick and thin with Ching He.

162
00:11:27,791 --> 00:11:32,833
I guarantee that I will bring a lot to Ching He.

163
00:11:34,291 --> 00:11:36,958
With the Hsueh family as Ching He's ally,

164
00:11:37,541 --> 00:11:39,500
things will be much easier.

165
00:11:40,583 --> 00:11:43,166
It's just that Thackery won't step down.

166
00:11:43,666 --> 00:11:46,458
If Madam Fan wants to take over,

167
00:11:46,541 --> 00:11:48,458
there are still some uncertainty.

168
00:11:50,291 --> 00:11:53,833
With the Hsueh family's backing, we are stronger.

169
00:11:53,916 --> 00:11:57,916
But Ching He has always remained neutral.

170
00:11:58,666 --> 00:12:01,916
That's something to keep in mind.

171
00:12:07,583 --> 00:12:09,791
I wasn't sure about saying this,

172
00:12:10,458 --> 00:12:12,541
but now that we have you, Sir Hong,

173
00:12:12,625 --> 00:12:13,875
everything will be fine.

174
00:12:14,375 --> 00:12:17,791
I heard that the head of Ching He has two keys.

175
00:12:17,875 --> 00:12:20,541
Thackery has one of them.

176
00:12:21,541 --> 00:12:23,333
Where is the other one?

177
00:12:28,041 --> 00:12:29,208
It's with me.

178
00:12:32,541 --> 00:12:35,208
Are you willing to hand it over now?

179
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:38,583
It's not yet time for the inauguration ceremony.

180
00:12:39,541 --> 00:12:42,958
Handing it over now doesn't feel right, does it?

181
00:12:44,750 --> 00:12:45,958
Sir Hong,

182
00:12:46,791 --> 00:12:48,833
we have already come this far.

183
00:12:49,625 --> 00:12:51,625
We can't afford any slipups.

184
00:13:01,041 --> 00:13:02,541
I understand.

185
00:13:15,833 --> 00:13:17,666
Do you think he will hand it over?

186
00:13:18,166 --> 00:13:19,833
If he has agreed to help me,

187
00:13:20,458 --> 00:13:22,833
he will make the right choice.

188
00:13:24,166 --> 00:13:28,083
Sir Hong's family has been with Ching He for generations.

189
00:13:29,291 --> 00:13:35,541
No one could become Ching He's leader without his assistance.

190
00:13:36,916 --> 00:13:38,583
Now I can rest easy.

191
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:42,583
Oh, right.

192
00:13:43,416 --> 00:13:46,000
I heard two people have been giving you a headache.

193
00:13:46,666 --> 00:13:48,791
A headache? Who?

194
00:13:49,375 --> 00:13:51,875
Felix Chiang and Mina Shen.

195
00:13:52,916 --> 00:13:55,000
Louis wanted me

196
00:13:55,083 --> 00:13:56,833
to ask you to spare them.

197
00:13:57,708 --> 00:14:00,500
But he didn't tell me why you're after them.

198
00:14:01,208 --> 00:14:02,166
So I'm curious.

199
00:14:04,666 --> 00:14:07,750
They know something about an important client of mine.

200
00:14:08,916 --> 00:14:11,125
I merely gave them a warning.

201
00:14:11,708 --> 00:14:13,875
Since Louis has asked,

202
00:14:15,166 --> 00:14:17,916
of course I will help.

203
00:14:22,166 --> 00:14:27,375
But I'm also curious what his role is in all of this.

204
00:14:27,875 --> 00:14:29,875
If Thackery doesn't step down,

205
00:14:30,458 --> 00:14:31,708
Louis could help.

206
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,833
That's what he wants in return.

207
00:14:37,375 --> 00:14:38,583
I got it.

208
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,041
Thank you, Chairwoman.

209
00:14:42,791 --> 00:14:43,791
You're welcome,

210
00:14:44,291 --> 00:14:45,208
Mayor.

211
00:14:45,291 --> 00:14:46,833
It's a pleasure working with you.

212
00:15:22,625 --> 00:15:24,250
Did you know?

213
00:15:27,791 --> 00:15:29,333
Zoe is dead.

214
00:15:30,083 --> 00:15:32,125
What she wanted to give you is in my possession.

215
00:15:32,958 --> 00:15:34,791
But I didn't quite expect what's inside.

216
00:15:35,291 --> 00:15:36,791
So what do you plan to do now?

217
00:15:37,291 --> 00:15:38,875
Since it has to do with the Hsueh family…

218
00:15:40,791 --> 00:15:41,666
you can't have it.

219
00:15:44,166 --> 00:15:46,083
Are you going to betray Ching He?

220
00:15:47,708 --> 00:15:50,416
When I joined Ching He, I told you

221
00:15:50,500 --> 00:15:52,458
the Hsueh family would need me one day.

222
00:15:53,333 --> 00:15:55,250
I never thought it would be like this.

223
00:15:58,208 --> 00:15:59,791
Do you know

224
00:16:00,375 --> 00:16:03,958
why I let you join Ching He

225
00:16:04,750 --> 00:16:06,666
even though I knew you were a Hsueh?

226
00:16:06,750 --> 00:16:09,000
You wanted to use me to deal with the Hsuehs.

227
00:16:10,333 --> 00:16:12,166
You're different from your brother.

228
00:16:14,125 --> 00:16:15,375
Over the years,

229
00:16:15,875 --> 00:16:17,833
your performance in Ching He

230
00:16:18,333 --> 00:16:20,458
hasn't disappointed me.

231
00:16:21,083 --> 00:16:22,375
Even now,

232
00:16:23,166 --> 00:16:24,833
in my eyes,

233
00:16:25,625 --> 00:16:28,708
you are still the same Louis.

234
00:16:32,916 --> 00:16:34,166
Are you so sure?

235
00:16:37,791 --> 00:16:40,333
My brother made me a tempting offer.

236
00:16:41,333 --> 00:16:43,291
I will always be a Hsueh. You know that.

237
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,291
If you step down,

238
00:16:48,041 --> 00:16:49,583
I can guarantee your safety.

239
00:16:52,166 --> 00:16:53,958
You don't have to bother.

240
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:56,791
I know that my time has passed.

241
00:16:57,708 --> 00:17:00,583
I just hope that Ching He can remain stable.

242
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:04,833
If that requires me to step down, then I will.

243
00:17:06,083 --> 00:17:10,833
I only worry that if the Primordial Files fall into the wrong hands,

244
00:17:11,708 --> 00:17:15,708
the balance of the world will be broken.

245
00:17:16,875 --> 00:17:19,375
If that happens, I fear no one will be able to save it.

246
00:17:19,458 --> 00:17:22,375
Leave that to the next head of Ching He.

247
00:17:22,458 --> 00:17:23,791
Do you really think

248
00:17:23,875 --> 00:17:26,833
the Hsuehs will spare those who know about their secret

249
00:17:27,333 --> 00:17:32,083
if they find out about the video?

250
00:17:37,125 --> 00:17:39,625
The mayor has started asking.

251
00:17:40,458 --> 00:17:42,333
Make sure there are no loose ends.

252
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:46,916
After Thackery steps down,

253
00:17:47,416 --> 00:17:49,416
those who know about the Hsuehs' secret

254
00:17:49,958 --> 00:17:52,750
must not remain, understand?

255
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:54,458
Got it.

256
00:17:57,375 --> 00:17:58,208
Feeling better?

257
00:17:58,291 --> 00:17:59,541
Goldie?

258
00:18:00,333 --> 00:18:02,458
The doctor said they're just minor wounds.

259
00:18:02,541 --> 00:18:03,791
Luckily, no brain injury.

260
00:18:03,875 --> 00:18:05,791
He should be able to go home soon.

261
00:18:05,875 --> 00:18:08,125
I'm close to the head of neurology here.

262
00:18:08,208 --> 00:18:10,083
I'll ask him to come and take a look.

263
00:18:10,583 --> 00:18:12,458
Why haven't you been over for dinner lately?

264
00:18:12,958 --> 00:18:14,958
Howie, don't be rude.

265
00:18:15,583 --> 00:18:17,500
When you feel better, I'll come over.

266
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,958
But it doesn't seem to be safe at home now.

267
00:18:20,541 --> 00:18:22,791
Don't worry. They won't come again.

268
00:18:24,083 --> 00:18:26,375
Did you come to see my husband for something?

269
00:18:26,458 --> 00:18:28,083
Didn't he say he's quitting?

270
00:18:30,541 --> 00:18:31,875
I came to say goodbye to him.

271
00:18:31,958 --> 00:18:33,333
I will handle the rest myself.

272
00:18:38,458 --> 00:18:39,291
Why are you here?

273
00:18:51,208 --> 00:18:52,833
Did you see Thackery?

274
00:18:54,833 --> 00:18:56,333
Thackery has agreed to step down.

275
00:18:56,833 --> 00:18:58,250
Madam Fan will take over.

276
00:18:59,708 --> 00:19:00,750
Was it voluntary?

277
00:19:02,583 --> 00:19:04,041
He had no choice.

278
00:19:07,541 --> 00:19:08,541
What about the video?

279
00:19:09,125 --> 00:19:10,291
Did you give it to him?

280
00:19:12,458 --> 00:19:14,833
You know about the video. They won't spare you.

281
00:19:14,916 --> 00:19:17,333
There is still time before Madam Fan takes over.

282
00:19:17,416 --> 00:19:18,375
They won't act yet.

283
00:19:19,041 --> 00:19:22,041
-Take your family and go. -So you didn't give him the video.

284
00:19:24,916 --> 00:19:26,791
So now you want to help…

285
00:19:27,291 --> 00:19:29,500
help the Hsuehs and Madam Fan take over Ching He.

286
00:19:29,583 --> 00:19:31,583
This isn't something you should worry about.

287
00:19:32,083 --> 00:19:33,375
I've bought you time.

288
00:19:34,583 --> 00:19:37,125
Do you know how many people got hurt because of this?

289
00:19:38,208 --> 00:19:40,916
Fuck, I trusted you and thought you were a brother!

290
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,166
Fuck!

291
00:19:42,250 --> 00:19:43,791
This is for my son.

292
00:19:43,875 --> 00:19:45,666
For Zoe and her daughter!

293
00:19:45,750 --> 00:19:46,750
And Ben!

294
00:19:47,708 --> 00:19:50,416
All this just for the chairman position of Ching He!

295
00:19:50,500 --> 00:19:51,958
Is it worth so many lives?

296
00:19:52,916 --> 00:19:54,416
Fucking bastard!

297
00:20:06,958 --> 00:20:08,583
Take your family and go.

298
00:20:15,666 --> 00:20:16,541
Fuck.

299
00:20:24,333 --> 00:20:25,166
Where is your mom?

300
00:20:25,250 --> 00:20:28,291
She went to buy food. She'll be back soon.

301
00:20:30,041 --> 00:20:32,416
You're still studying? Doesn't your head hurt?

302
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:34,625
I'll still have exams when I'm discharged.

303
00:20:38,291 --> 00:20:39,750
It's all because I'm useless.

304
00:20:40,250 --> 00:20:42,000
I failed to protect you and your mom.

305
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:43,916
Hey, listen.

306
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,583
Next time this happens,

307
00:20:45,666 --> 00:20:47,708
the first thing you should do is run.

308
00:20:47,791 --> 00:20:49,375
Run quickly, understand?

309
00:20:49,458 --> 00:20:50,375
Dad,

310
00:20:51,041 --> 00:20:52,791
I know that if it were you,

311
00:20:52,875 --> 00:20:54,708
you would return to save Mom too.

312
00:20:55,625 --> 00:20:58,250
But I know you had more important things to handle.

313
00:21:01,958 --> 00:21:04,000
-He left? -Yeah.

314
00:21:05,375 --> 00:21:06,208
Hey.

315
00:21:06,708 --> 00:21:09,000
Get Howie's discharge papers tomorrow.

316
00:21:09,083 --> 00:21:10,541
Let's get out of here for a bit.

317
00:21:11,333 --> 00:21:12,750
You fought with your partner?

318
00:21:13,583 --> 00:21:15,125
Get away from here for a while?

319
00:21:15,916 --> 00:21:17,708
So how long are we going to hide?

320
00:21:19,375 --> 00:21:20,958
It's one thing for the two of us,

321
00:21:21,041 --> 00:21:23,583
but do you want our son to hide with us forever?

322
00:21:30,458 --> 00:21:32,833
Take care of your business.

323
00:21:33,375 --> 00:21:37,750
Or do you plan to wait until your hand tremors worsen?

324
00:21:45,958 --> 00:21:47,708
I've been with you for so many years.

325
00:21:48,291 --> 00:21:50,416
You think I don't know you?

326
00:21:50,916 --> 00:21:52,041
I also know

327
00:21:52,916 --> 00:21:54,708
you've been looking after Chi's family.

328
00:21:56,625 --> 00:21:58,375
I'm just upset

329
00:21:58,875 --> 00:22:00,958
that you're keeping this from me.

330
00:22:03,666 --> 00:22:08,375
I'll handle the discharge in a few days and take our son to my mother's.

331
00:22:08,958 --> 00:22:11,833
Sort out your situation before then

332
00:22:13,083 --> 00:22:14,958
and return safely.

333
00:22:15,833 --> 00:22:16,916
Do you hear me?

334
00:22:23,583 --> 00:22:24,708
Don't worry.

335
00:22:25,208 --> 00:22:26,750
Until you get back,

336
00:22:26,833 --> 00:22:28,750
I will protect your wife.

337
00:22:29,333 --> 00:22:31,583
Don't copy your dad's nonsense.

338
00:23:05,791 --> 00:23:07,000
It'll be fine. Hang on.

339
00:23:07,083 --> 00:23:08,708
Hang in there, you hear me?

340
00:23:09,208 --> 00:23:10,041
At worst,

341
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:12,333
we do it ourselves.

342
00:24:23,458 --> 00:24:24,583
Lord Guan,

343
00:24:25,166 --> 00:24:28,291
get me out alive.

344
00:24:45,125 --> 00:24:46,541
Do it properly.

345
00:24:47,541 --> 00:24:48,375
Remember.

346
00:24:59,208 --> 00:25:01,958
Swamp Eel, long time no see.

347
00:25:02,708 --> 00:25:05,708
Aren't you a bit old to be running the streets?

348
00:25:06,291 --> 00:25:07,875
I'm here for your boss.

349
00:25:13,208 --> 00:25:14,916
I'm here to ask a favor.

350
00:25:16,958 --> 00:25:17,958
For whom?

351
00:25:18,041 --> 00:25:19,375
Your old acquaintance,

352
00:25:20,166 --> 00:25:21,208
Thackery Huang.

353
00:25:24,375 --> 00:25:26,291
How do you want me to help you?

354
00:25:27,583 --> 00:25:29,500
Stop Fan from taking over Ching He.

355
00:25:33,333 --> 00:25:36,916
Are you out of your mind? You want to drag San He in?

356
00:25:37,416 --> 00:25:39,458
If San He intervenes,

357
00:25:40,333 --> 00:25:44,416
that's declaring war on the Hsueh family and Yeh Yueh Tong.

358
00:25:47,708 --> 00:25:49,208
Don't forget.

359
00:25:49,291 --> 00:25:51,916
You guys deposed the elder Fan back then

360
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:53,500
and supported Thackery.

361
00:25:53,583 --> 00:25:56,833
If you now let Fan take over,

362
00:25:58,708 --> 00:26:00,125
you might be in trouble.

363
00:26:02,958 --> 00:26:05,333
Besides, you should know very well

364
00:26:05,833 --> 00:26:07,375
what kind of person Fan is.

365
00:26:13,833 --> 00:26:15,625
If we can't play fair, we fight dirty.

366
00:26:16,208 --> 00:26:18,250
Now that's different.

367
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:24,916
ARCADE

368
00:26:34,500 --> 00:26:36,333
Did Louis send you here?

369
00:26:37,583 --> 00:26:38,625
No.

370
00:26:39,875 --> 00:26:40,875
I want to see you.

371
00:26:41,666 --> 00:26:43,208
We have a common enemy.

372
00:26:44,041 --> 00:26:45,958
I can help you take out Madam Fan.

373
00:26:48,500 --> 00:26:49,500
Why?

374
00:26:50,500 --> 00:26:53,291
That motherfucker went after my family.

375
00:26:59,125 --> 00:27:01,291
At least you still have people you can protect.

376
00:27:07,125 --> 00:27:07,958
It's fine.

377
00:27:08,458 --> 00:27:09,750
I shouldn't have come.

378
00:27:10,250 --> 00:27:12,208
Ben wouldn't want you to avenge him.

379
00:27:13,625 --> 00:27:14,916
I'll go with you.

380
00:27:17,416 --> 00:27:19,541
Those two know I won't let that go easily.

381
00:27:22,041 --> 00:27:23,708
At worst, when we finally meet,

382
00:27:23,791 --> 00:27:25,666
they will nag at me.

383
00:27:37,041 --> 00:27:38,625
I told you, we're here to visit.

384
00:27:38,708 --> 00:27:39,708
Must I repeat myself?

385
00:27:39,791 --> 00:27:41,458
You're not family. You can't enter.

386
00:27:41,541 --> 00:27:42,833
Since when is that a rule?

387
00:27:43,416 --> 00:27:45,250
Quiet. Don't disturb other patients.

388
00:27:45,333 --> 00:27:48,791
Don't be like this. You make it seem like we're here to collect debts.

389
00:27:48,875 --> 00:27:50,291
You look like debt collectors.

390
00:27:50,375 --> 00:27:52,041
Who brings fruit to collect debts?

391
00:27:52,916 --> 00:27:54,250
-Ma'am. -Milky.

392
00:27:54,875 --> 00:27:57,500
Sorry, nurse, we know each other.

393
00:27:57,583 --> 00:28:00,625
Smile. You looked scary, so she got the wrong idea.

394
00:28:00,708 --> 00:28:02,125
Tell them to quiet down.

395
00:28:02,208 --> 00:28:04,416
Okay. Sorry. Thank you.

396
00:28:05,875 --> 00:28:09,416
Why did you bring so many people?

397
00:28:09,500 --> 00:28:12,083
Well, Loach called and said he had stuff to deal with.

398
00:28:12,166 --> 00:28:13,750
He sent me here to protect you.

399
00:28:15,583 --> 00:28:16,416
The fruit!

400
00:28:17,750 --> 00:28:20,208
Damn it, bring it inside. Don't make her hold it.

401
00:28:32,083 --> 00:28:36,000
Why do you only eat blood pudding and deep-fried tofu for tien-bu-la?

402
00:28:37,875 --> 00:28:40,833
After my parents passed away, I was forced to live with my aunt.

403
00:28:42,041 --> 00:28:45,166
Her favorite thing to cook was radish and pork meatball soup.

404
00:28:48,083 --> 00:28:49,625
I've heard Ben mention it.

405
00:28:51,291 --> 00:28:52,666
That big mouth.

406
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:56,041
I told him that after I retire,

407
00:28:56,125 --> 00:28:58,416
I'd open a swamp eel noodle stall next to his.

408
00:28:58,500 --> 00:28:59,875
He hated the idea.

409
00:29:01,625 --> 00:29:04,958
Before he died, he mentioned the stall to me.

410
00:29:06,875 --> 00:29:08,625
He probably meant to say it to you.

411
00:29:30,083 --> 00:29:31,500
You didn't invite me here

412
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:33,916
just for small talk, right?

413
00:29:35,125 --> 00:29:36,750
I heard

414
00:29:37,250 --> 00:29:40,208
that you want to replace Thackery

415
00:29:40,916 --> 00:29:44,000
and become Ching He's new chairwoman.

416
00:29:46,250 --> 00:29:48,250
The news spread fast.

417
00:29:48,958 --> 00:29:51,958
It seems that San He has eyes and ears everywhere.

418
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:55,166
This is a big deal for San He.

419
00:29:55,958 --> 00:29:57,333
No matter who takes over,

420
00:29:57,833 --> 00:30:02,458
we will continue to count on Ching He's support whenever needed.

421
00:30:04,500 --> 00:30:05,750
No problem.

422
00:30:13,833 --> 00:30:15,291
We each take a spot.

423
00:30:15,375 --> 00:30:17,416
Shoot whenever there's a chance.

424
00:30:18,416 --> 00:30:21,958
If one of us fails, there will still be a second chance.

425
00:30:26,208 --> 00:30:29,708
San He and Ching He have always had strong ties.

426
00:30:30,208 --> 00:30:31,625
But don't forget.

427
00:30:31,708 --> 00:30:36,458
If my father hadn't insisted on allying with you despite the objections,

428
00:30:36,958 --> 00:30:38,916
we wouldn't have become so close.

429
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:40,750
Of course I remember.

430
00:30:40,833 --> 00:30:43,375
My brother speaks highly of your father.

431
00:30:44,083 --> 00:30:45,250
We're forever grateful.

432
00:30:47,291 --> 00:30:49,500
So why bite the hand that feeds you?

433
00:30:54,208 --> 00:30:58,875
I still remember how you worked with Thackery

434
00:30:58,958 --> 00:31:01,125
to accuse me of killing our own fixers.

435
00:31:03,125 --> 00:31:05,291
Do you intend to do it again?

436
00:31:25,583 --> 00:31:27,833
Put down the gun, or I'll shoot.

437
00:31:38,416 --> 00:31:39,708
Madam Fan can't die.

438
00:31:51,250 --> 00:31:55,083
So this is how San He shows hospitality.

439
00:31:55,958 --> 00:31:56,833
A misunderstanding.

440
00:31:57,416 --> 00:31:59,208
There must be a huge misunderstanding.

441
00:31:59,708 --> 00:32:01,750
Hey, go down and take a look.

442
00:32:08,333 --> 00:32:10,000
Next time, come to my place.

443
00:32:12,416 --> 00:32:14,166
At least it will be safer.

444
00:32:18,833 --> 00:32:21,083
I won't bother them while they catch up.

445
00:32:46,166 --> 00:32:49,041
Damn it. It'll be harder next time.

446
00:32:49,125 --> 00:32:50,000
Fuck!

447
00:33:02,458 --> 00:33:03,458
Sir Hong,

448
00:33:04,375 --> 00:33:05,708
are you a traitor too?

449
00:33:10,458 --> 00:33:12,041
Everything has been taken care of.

450
00:33:12,875 --> 00:33:16,125
Looks like all that's left is the inauguration ceremony.

451
00:33:16,625 --> 00:33:18,500
Thank you for your support, Chairwoman.

452
00:33:19,375 --> 00:33:22,166
And I must thank your brother for saving me.

453
00:33:29,541 --> 00:33:33,375
Everything's set. Now we just wait for Sir Hong to organize the inauguration.

454
00:33:36,083 --> 00:33:40,375
The Thackery I know won't comply so easily.

455
00:33:40,875 --> 00:33:43,583
I'm worried that when he is released from custody,

456
00:33:44,375 --> 00:33:46,125
he will play other tricks.

457
00:33:50,958 --> 00:33:53,333
Too bad we don't know where he hid his key.

458
00:33:54,375 --> 00:33:57,833
Thackery's ring is his key.

459
00:33:59,458 --> 00:34:01,583
It's just that the ring hasn't been found.

460
00:34:02,416 --> 00:34:04,250
If Thackery hid his key,

461
00:34:04,750 --> 00:34:06,958
only Sir Hong would know where it might be.

462
00:34:07,041 --> 00:34:09,666
Sometimes, the most dangerous place is the safest.

463
00:34:09,750 --> 00:34:11,333
It should be in Ching He Temple.

464
00:34:17,416 --> 00:34:18,583
Your brother said

465
00:34:19,625 --> 00:34:21,708
you helped him a lot.

466
00:34:25,250 --> 00:34:26,416
Good.

467
00:34:27,416 --> 00:34:29,333
You have finally come around.

468
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:40,916
Isn't this what you wanted most?

469
00:34:41,666 --> 00:34:45,333
Tristan can finally carry on your family legacy.

470
00:34:48,791 --> 00:34:50,291
Do you know

471
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:54,541
how many people want to use our family to climb the ladder?

472
00:34:55,541 --> 00:34:58,541
Or even replace us?

473
00:35:01,250 --> 00:35:02,083
Dad,

474
00:35:02,625 --> 00:35:06,416
if Tristan went down the wrong path trying to reach the top,

475
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:08,666
would you still support him?

476
00:35:10,250 --> 00:35:14,416
I forced your brother onto this path.

477
00:35:15,625 --> 00:35:17,291
If he went astray,

478
00:35:18,500 --> 00:35:20,291
I would be to blame too.

479
00:35:21,166 --> 00:35:23,541
Is this what you want or what he wants?

480
00:35:24,791 --> 00:35:27,250
We are all doing this for the Hsueh family.

481
00:35:29,333 --> 00:35:31,083
To protect this family,

482
00:35:31,666 --> 00:35:35,958
sometimes you have to remove a few pebbles along the way

483
00:35:36,458 --> 00:35:38,458
for the greater good.

484
00:35:41,916 --> 00:35:43,166
Louis…

485
00:35:44,791 --> 00:35:46,791
my days are numbered.

486
00:35:47,500 --> 00:35:49,375
Your brother's path forward

487
00:35:50,166 --> 00:35:52,375
now depends on the two of you.

488
00:35:54,958 --> 00:35:56,458
Dad, don't worry.

489
00:35:57,416 --> 00:36:00,541
Leave it to us brothers. Get some rest.

490
00:36:20,708 --> 00:36:23,000
INVITATION, CHING HE FIXER CELESTIAL INAUGURATION

491
00:37:04,250 --> 00:37:06,708
CELESTIAL, EARTH, SOLAR, LUNAR

492
00:41:02,541 --> 00:41:05,333
Subtitle translation by: Hannah Liu
